{"fps": 30, "frames": 1715, "beats": [{"a": 0, "b": 131, "text": "The world's most famous stock exchange was born from a crash.", "words": [{"w": "The", "f": 0, "e": 4}, {"w": "world's", "f": 7, "e": 16}, {"w": "most", "f": 19, "e": 22}, {"w": "famous", "f": 27, "e": 36}, {"w": "stock", "f": 38, "e": 44}, {"w": "exchange", "f": 47, "e": 62}, {"w": "was", "f": 67, "e": 71}, {"w": "born", "f": 73, "e": 82}, {"w": "from", "f": 84, "e": 87}, {"w": "a", "f": 89, "e": 91}, {"w": "crash.", "f": 93, "e": 109}]}, {"a": 131, "b": 289, "text": "New York, seventeen ninety-two. Everyone wants to lend to William Duer.", "words": [{"w": "New", "f": 133, "e": 138}, {"w": "York,", "f": 140, "e": 158}, {"w": "seventeen", "f": 160, "e": 171}, {"w": "ninety-two.", "f": 176, "e": 193}, {"w": "Everyone", "f": 218, "e": 229}, {"w": "wants", "f": 231, "e": 238}, {"w": "to", "f": 239, "e": 240}, {"w": "lend", "f": 242, "e": 249}, {"w": "to", "f": 251, "e": 253}, {"w": "William", "f": 256, "e": 264}, {"w": "Duer.", "f": 267, "e": 278}]}, {"a": 289, "b": 360, "text": "He was Hamilton's assistant at the Treasury.", "words": [{"w": "He", "f": 291, "e": 293}, {"w": "was", "f": 296, "e": 298}, {"w": "Hamilton's", "f": 300, "e": 311}, {"w": "assistant", "f": 313, "e": 327}, {"w": "at", "f": 328, "e": 329}, {"w": "the", "f": 331, "e": 333}, {"w": "Treasury.", "f": 336, "e": 349}]}, {"a": 360, "b": 514, "text": "With rich partner Alexander Macomb, he borrows big to corner government bonds.", "words": [{"w": "With", "f": 362, "e": 367}, {"w": "rich", "f": 369, "e": 373}, {"w": "partner", "f": 376, "e": 387}, {"w": "Alexander", "f": 389, "e": 404}, {"w": "Macomb,", "f": 408, "e": 427}, {"w": "he", "f": 429, "e": 433}, {"w": "borrows", "f": 436, "e": 444}, {"w": "big", "f": 449, "e": 458}, {"w": "to", "f": 460, "e": 462}, {"w": "corner", "f": 464, "e": 473}, {"w": "government", "f": 476, "e": 484}, {"w": "bonds.", "f": 487, "e": 508}]}, {"a": 514, "b": 596, "text": "Short of cash? They sign each other's notes.", "words": [{"w": "Short", "f": 516, "e": 520}, {"w": "of", "f": 522, "e": 523}, {"w": "cash?", "f": 524, "e": 538}, {"w": "They", "f": 549, "e": 551}, {"w": "sign", "f": 553, "e": 558}, {"w": "each", "f": 560, "e": 562}, {"w": "other's", "f": 564, "e": 569}, {"w": "notes.", "f": 571, "e": 590}]}, {"a": 596, "b": 682, "text": "Then, in March, Duer stops paying.", "words": [{"w": "Then,", "f": 598, "e": 611}, {"w": "in", "f": 613, "e": 616}, {"w": "March,", "f": 618, "e": 638}, {"w": "Duer", "f": 640, "e": 649}, {"w": "stops", "f": 654, "e": 660}, {"w": "paying.", "f": 662, "e": 673}]}, {"a": 682, "b": 849, "text": "Prices fall over twenty percent in weeks. Duer lands in debtors' prison.", "words": [{"w": "Prices", "f": 684, "e": 698}, {"w": "fall", "f": 702, "e": 709}, {"w": "over", "f": 711, "e": 718}, {"w": "twenty", "f": 720, "e": 727}, {"w": "percent", "f": 731, "e": 744}, {"w": "in", "f": 747, "e": 749}, {"w": "weeks.", "f": 753, "e": 767}, {"w": "Duer", "f": 780, "e": 789}, {"w": "lands", "f": 791, "e": 800}, {"w": "in", "f": 801, "e": 802}, {"w": "debtors'", "f": 807, "e": 816}, {"w": "prison.", "f": 817, "e": 839}]}, {"a": 849, "b": 924, "text": "So how did that build Wall Street?", "words": [{"w": "So", "f": 851, "e": 858}, {"w": "how", "f": 864, "e": 869}, {"w": "did", "f": 871, "e": 873}, {"w": "that", "f": 878, "e": 884}, {"w": "build", "f": 887, "e": 893}, {"w": "Wall", "f": 896, "e": 900}, {"w": "Street?", "f": 902, "e": 924}]}, {"a": 924, "b": 1060, "text": "You see, borrowing is standing on a friend's shoulders to reach the top shelf.", "words": [{"w": "You", "f": 926, "e": 927}, {"w": "see,", "f": 929, "e": 942}, {"w": "borrowing", "f": 944, "e": 962}, {"w": "is", "f": 964, "e": 969}, {"w": "standing", "f": 974, "e": 980}, {"w": "on", "f": 981, "e": 982}, {"w": "a", "f": 984, "e": 987}, {"w": "friend's", "f": 989, "e": 998}, {"w": "shoulders", "f": 1002, "e": 1013}, {"w": "to", "f": 1016, "e": 1018}, {"w": "reach", "f": 1020, "e": 1024}, {"